*This framework builds on principles from the [E² Resonance Framework](#e2-resonance "meta:corresponds_to") {#e2-resonance}, [Attention-Fluctuation Dynamics](#af-dynamics "ontological:composes") {#af-dynamics}, [Adaptation via Informational Abstraction](#adaptation-abstraction "ontological:composes") {#adaptation-abstraction}, and collaborative analysis with multiple AI systems. It represents an attempt to translate relational complexity insights into practical tools for understanding and transforming the complex systems we inhabit.*

